{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-effectiveness-utility-qaly","title":"成本效果与成本效用分析（QALY）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision/cost-effectiveness-utility-qaly","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本效果与成本效用分析-qaly\">成本效果与成本效用分析（QALY）</h1><p>假设一国卫生部门手里有 1000 万元，面前摆着两个方案：A 方案能让 100 名癌症患者各多活 2 年，B 方案能让 500 名关节炎患者从疼痛缠身变成行动自如但寿命不变。哪个更值得投？比较「多活的年数」和「改善的生活质量」就像比较苹果和橘子——除非找到一个能同时容纳生命长度与生命质量的统一单位。质量调整生命年（QALY）就是为此而生的「健康货币」，它是整个经济评价大厦的计量基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>经济评价的任务是系统比较不同医疗方案的成本与产出，帮助在预算约束下做出「钱花在哪最划算」的决策。根据「产出」如何衡量，经济评价分为几种类型，它们共享成本的测算方法，但在产出度量上层层递进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[经济评价: 比较成本与产出] --&gt; B[成本最小化分析 CMA&lt;br/&gt;产出相同 只比成本]&#10;  A --&gt; C[成本效果分析 CEA&lt;br/&gt;产出: 自然单位 如生命年]&#10;  A --&gt; D[成本效用分析 CUA&lt;br/&gt;产出: QALY 含质量]&#10;  A --&gt; E[成本效益分析 CBA&lt;br/&gt;产出: 货币]&#10;  C --&gt; F[ICER = 增量成本 / 增量效果]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; G[QALY = 生存年数 × 健康效用权重]&#10;  F --&gt; H[与阈值比较 决定是否采纳]\">graph TD\n  A[经济评价: 比较成本与产出] --&gt; B[成本最小化分析 CMA&lt;br/&gt;产出相同 只比成本]\n  A --&gt; C[成本效果分析 CEA&lt;br/&gt;产出: 自然单位 如生命年]\n  A --&gt; D[成本效用分析 CUA&lt;br/&gt;产出: QALY 含质量]\n  A --&gt; E[成本效益分析 CBA&lt;br/&gt;产出: 货币]\n  C --&gt; F[ICER = 增量成本 / 增量效果]\n  D --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; G[QALY = 生存年数 × 健康效用权重]\n  F --&gt; H[与阈值比较 决定是否采纳]</pre><p>下表对比四种经济评价方法的产出度量与适用场景，这是理解后续讨论的导航图。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>产出度量</th>\n<th>能否跨病种比较</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本最小化 (CMA)</td>\n<td>假定产出相同</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>两方案疗效已知等同，只比成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本效果 (CEA)</td>\n<td>自然单位（生命年、降压 mmHg）</td>\n<td>有限（同一单位才行）</td>\n<td>同类疾病、同一结局指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本效用 (CUA)</td>\n<td>QALY（生命年×质量权重）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨病种资源分配、医保报销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本效益 (CBA)</td>\n<td>货币</td>\n<td>是（与非健康项目也可比）</td>\n<td>需把健康折算成钱，详见 VSL 篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本效果分析与增量成本效果比\">成本效果分析与增量成本效果比</h2><p>成本效果分析（CEA）用「自然单位」衡量产出——比如每延长一个生命年的成本、每降低一例死亡的成本。它的核心产出是增量成本效果比（ICER）：比较新方案相对于旧方案，每多产出一单位健康要多花多少钱。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ICER</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>新</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>旧</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>新</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>旧</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ICER} = \\frac{C_{\\text{新}} - C_{\\text{旧}}}{E_{\\text{新}} - E_{\\text{旧}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ICER</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">旧</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">旧</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是效果。比如新疗法比旧疗法每人多花 5 万元，多带来 2.5 个生命年，则 ICER = 2 万元/生命年。ICER 越低，方案越划算。CEA 的局限在于：它只能比较用相同自然单位衡量的方案——「每延长一生命年的成本」无法和「每减轻一例疼痛的成本」直接比较。要跨病种比较，就必须升级到 QALY。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qaly-把生命的长度与质量合成一个数\">QALY：把生命的长度与质量合成一个数</h2><p>QALY 的思想极其优雅：把一年的「完全健康」生命定义为 1 个 QALY，把死亡定义为 0；任何带病的生存状态，则按其健康相关生活质量打一个介于 0 和 1 之间的「效用权重」，再乘以处于该状态的年数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>QALY</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{QALY} = \\sum_t Q_t \\times T_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QALY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 段时间的健康效用权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该段时间的长度。举例：一个人在效用为 0.6 的中度残疾状态下活 10 年，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6 \\times 10 = 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个 QALY；若一项治疗能把效用提到 0.8 并维持 10 年，则产生 8 个 QALY，净增 2 个 QALY。</p>\n<p>效用权重从哪来？主要靠标准化的健康量表（如 EQ-5D，从行动、自理、日常活动、疼痛、焦虑五个维度描述健康状态），再用人群偏好调查把每种状态映射成一个效用值。值得注意的是，英国 NICE 在 2026 年宣布更新其 EQ-5D 价值集，这会改变许多疗法的 QALY 计算结果与报销结论。</p>\n<p>下表用几种典型健康状态展示效用权重的直觉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>健康状态</th>\n<th>大致效用权重</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全健康</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>满分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制良好的慢性病</td>\n<td>0.8–0.9</td>\n<td>轻微影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中度残疾/慢性疼痛</td>\n<td>0.5–0.7</td>\n<td>明显影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重度依赖他人照护</td>\n<td>0.2–0.4</td>\n<td>严重受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「生不如死」的极端状态</td>\n<td>可为负</td>\n<td>比死亡更糟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-icer-到决策-成本效用比与阈值\">从 ICER 到决策：成本效用比与阈值</h2><p>把 QALY 代入 ICER，就得到成本效用分析（CUA）的核心指标——每多一个 QALY 的成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ICER</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>QALY</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ICER} = \\frac{\\Delta C}{\\Delta \\text{QALY}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ICER</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QALY</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个数字让来自完全不同疾病领域的方案第一次可以同台比较：抗癌药、降压药、髋关节置换，统统归算成「每 QALY 多少钱」。决策者再把它与一条成本效果阈值比较——低于阈值则采纳，高于则拒绝。英国 NICE 长期使用 2 万到 3 万英镑/QALY 的阈值，并在 2026 年四月上调至 2.5 万到 3.5 万英镑/QALY，这是二十年来首次。阈值如何确定、HTA 机构如何运用它做真实报销决策，是下一篇<a href=\"health-technology-assessment\">健康技术评估</a>的主题。</p>\n<p>CUA 评价的对象，正是上一章<a href=\"../supply-insurance/pharmaceutical-economics-innovation\">医药经济学与创新</a>里那些昂贵的新药；它产出的「该不该报销」结论，又会反过来约束<a href=\"../supply-insurance/provider-supply-induced-demand\">供给诱导需求</a>中供给侧的过度扩张。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qaly-的争议与局限\">QALY 的争议与局限</h2><p>QALY 虽强大，却饱受伦理质疑。最尖锐的批评是它隐含「歧视」——同样一项救命治疗，用在年轻人身上产生的 QALY 比用在老人身上多（剩余寿命长），用在健康人身上比用在残疾人身上多（基线效用高），这似乎系统性地低估了老年人和残疾人的生命。为缓解这一问题，部分机构引入了对严重疾病、生命终末期的「加权」修正。</p>\n<p>另一类批评针对效用权重的测量：用谁的偏好（患者还是公众）、用什么方法（时间权衡法还是标准博弈法）会得出不同的权重，进而改变结论。尽管争议不断，QALY 仍是目前唯一被广泛接受、能跨病种比较健康产出的工具。要把「健康」进一步折算成「金钱」以便和非健康政策比较，则需要<a href=\"value-of-health-vsl\">生命统计价值（VSL）</a>登场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>经济评价按产出度量分为 CMA、CEA、CUA、CBA，逐级增强跨方案可比性。</li>\n<li>CEA 用自然单位、靠 ICER（增量成本/增量效果）排序，但无法跨病种比较。</li>\n<li>QALY 把生命的长度与质量合成一个数：年数 × 介于 0（死亡）与 1（完全健康）的效用权重。</li>\n<li>CUA 用「每 QALY 成本」让所有疾病领域的方案同台比较，再与阈值（NICE 2026 年上调至 2.5 万–3.5 万英镑/QALY）对照决策。</li>\n<li>QALY 受「歧视老人与残疾人」「效用测量主观」等伦理与方法学批评，但仍是跨病种比较的唯一通用工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本效果与成本效用分析（QALY）","id":"成本效果与成本效用分析-qaly"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本效果分析与增量成本效果比","id":"成本效果分析与增量成本效果比"},{"level":2,"text":"QALY：把生命的长度与质量合成一个数","id":"qaly-把生命的长度与质量合成一个数"},{"level":2,"text":"从 ICER 到决策：成本效用比与阈值","id":"从-icer-到决策-成本效用比与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"QALY 的争议与局限","id":"qaly-的争议与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"医药经济学与创新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/pharmaceutical-economics-innovation"},"next":{"title":"健康技术评估（HTA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision/health-technology-assessment"}}